    // ---- find-factories 2026-10-04: candidates verified and REJECTED, by reason.
    // None of these is configured, so no blacklist entries are needed.
    //
    // (a) V2 PairCreated, but the pair has no swap(uint256,uint256,address,bytes).
    //     FlashArbExecutor._hop calls exactly that selector, so these cannot be
    //     routed whatever their price. The big three are one product: 0xd7d3…
    //     stops at block 43,898,438 and 0x488d… starts at 43,899,749 — a
    //     factory redeployed in place, the usual shape of a token launchpad
    //     whose "pairs" are bonding curves rather than AMMs.
    //       0xd7d3c85b4f2e9bee1998cd2e98820e647792d284  21,877   0x488db0978b34c6fd901760b9024b565c1117c7c8  21,319
    //       0x158d7ccaa23dc3c8861c3323ed546e3d25e74309  17,357   0x25e89b02f0c62b67622b4ebd629c882a73d8cabc   3,915
    //       0x2f77b40c124645d25782cfbdfb1f54c1d76f2cce   1,931   0x80f510b37dc4541e96b851725c8c6e527bca5a06     620
    //       + 25 smaller (19-173 pairs): bb95f2f9 adcf328a e47c9de2 25510795 fc7fe12a 6b52d962 5c05983f
    //         6e5f6061 420b57eb a266d50b cd9809f4 66d2cf2e b60ffba6 f0ebc391 41b612ed a4ee225e dd4536dd
    //         e1571382 5d5fd72b 0b545387 1d5852b9 49cbad99 3e491452 5e8e8b2d 669bab4a
    // (b) Sampled pair has no bytecode — dead: 0xe2fb132c… (97), 0xf0f84abc… (28).
    // (c) V3 PoolCreated, but no swap callback we recognise in the pool code.
    //     Irrelevant until the executor trades V3; then identify the callback
    //     from a pool's bytecode and add it to KNOWN_CALLBACKS:
    //       0x1d470e77e9980aa342646434c800f439ed3489c1  961   0x27c960dedfb96c74c30d77972b3394a5621f65d0  922
    //       0x7b72c4002ea7c276dd717b96b20f4956c5c904e7  894   + d6ab0566 (50), 5fd88cd0 (30), e8839bf8 (24), c05a5aa5 (20)
    // (d) Algebra (globalState/tickTable, dynamic fee) — not modelled yet:
    //       0x36077d39cdc65e1e3fb65810430e5b2c4d5fa29e  954   + ac900f12 (173), c5396866 (144), efcb993e (51),
    //       6e606cf9 (35), c207628e (23)
    // (e) PoolCreated emitters whose pools are not slot0-shaped at all:
